  "meta": {
    "title": "Event",
    "description": "A date, a title and the details, with a photo strip. DateDay + DateMonth: the day number and the short month (OCT). Headline: the event in 2 to 6 words. Details: time and place on one or two lines. CTA + CTAText: 2 or 3 words (RSVP, Book a spot). Photo: set its fills to a photo (fit crop), or delete it for text only. Logo (the business name in text; with a logo in the brand kit, delete it and place the logo image in its box)."
